                                                   <TextBlock
                                                         Classes="docs-noteBody"
                                                         Text="Unsupported: generated StaticResource padding keys only cover physical directions (Padding*, PaddingX*, PaddingY*, PaddingTop*, PaddingRight*, PaddingBottom*, and PaddingLeft*). Logical ps-/pe-/pbs-/pbe- and visual psv-/pev- aliases are still parser-only."/>
                                              </StackPanel>
